.TH LIBUTF8_REPLACEMENT_CHARACTER_CODEPOINT 3 LIBUTF8
.SH NAME
LIBUTF8_REPLACEMENT_CHARACTER_CODEPOINT - Unicode replacement character as a codepoint

.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <libutf8.h>

#define \fBLIBUTF8_REPLACEMENT_CHARACTER_CODEPOINT\fP /* implementation omitted */
.fi

.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B LIBUTF8_REPLACEMENT_CHARACTER_CODEPOINT
macro expands the codepoint of U+FFFD REPLACEMENT CHARACTER
expressed as an unsigned integer that is at least 16 bits
wide and interpretable by the preprocessor

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libutf8 (7),
.BR LIBUTF8_REPLACEMENT_CHARACTER_UTF8 (3),
.BR LIBUTF8_REPLACE_INVALID (3)
